@ key bytes -> { istate0..4 ostate0..4 }, the HMAC-SHA1 midstates (as in ACCTS)
\<< \-> k
  \<<
    IF k SIZE 64 > THEN "Secret too long" DOERR END
    MKWRK
    #67452301h #EFCDAB89h #98BADCFEh #10325476h #C3D2E1F0h 5 \->LIST k 54 PADB WRK SHAC
    #67452301h #EFCDAB89h #98BADCFEh #10325476h #C3D2E1F0h 5 \->LIST k 92 PADB WRK SHAC
    +
  \>>
\>>
